---
// src/components/NetworkContributions.astro
const ALPENGLOW_IDENTITY = '2CY5tXmmEAQ5bwBdv4Yt74T4Gjfz92h1vbETrBdBWNj6';
const ALPENGLOW_VOTE     = '2qdeoX3GL1Gpvf8g5XAF2TmSsbaCmzTv3TGmimnZcHQW';
---

<section class="section ecosystem-section" id="ecosystem">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-header fade-in">
      <span class="section-label">Beyond running a node</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Active in the ecosystem</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Things Solya does for Solana beyond keeping the mainnet validator
        online: volunteering for early protocol testing, building open-source
        tooling, and shipping public goods together with the community.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="ecosystem-grid">

      <!-- Alpenglow Genesis -->
      <article class="ecosystem-card ecosystem-card--featured fade-in">
        <div class="ecosystem-card-top">
          <div class="ecosystem-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">🏔</div>
          <span class="ecosystem-tag ecosystem-tag--cyan">Alpenglow community cluster</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ecosystem-card-title">Alpenglow Genesis Validator</h3>
        <p class="ecosystem-card-body">
          Solya joined the Alpenglow community test cluster in the second
          wave (May 15, 2026, 86 validators). The initiative was proposed
          by the Solana Foundation on a community call. Solya was glad to
          step in. The point is simple: volunteer help so the upcoming
          consensus change is tested in real conditions, and the eventual
          mainnet switch happens smoothly.
        </p>

        <div class="ecosystem-keys">
          <div class="ecosystem-key-row">
            <span class="ecosystem-key-label">Identity</span>
            <code class="ecosystem-key-value">{ALPENGLOW_IDENTITY}</code>
          </div>
          <div class="ecosystem-key-row">
            <span class="ecosystem-key-label">Vote</span>
            <code class="ecosystem-key-value">{ALPENGLOW_VOTE}</code>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="ecosystem-card-note">
          Alpenglow cluster only · not for delegation
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Colosseum Frontier -->
      <article class="ecosystem-card fade-in">
        <div class="ecosystem-card-top">
          <div class="ecosystem-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">🏟</div>
          <span class="ecosystem-tag ecosystem-tag--magenta">Submitted · May 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ecosystem-card-title">Colosseum Frontier 2026</h3>
        <p class="ecosystem-card-body">
          Submitted SONDA to the Colosseum Frontier Hackathon
          (April 6 to May 11). Shipped during the hackathon: a live public
          dashboard at sonda.network covering all three Solana clusters,
          cross-verified geolocation, infrastructure monitoring, per-validator
          pages, and event alerts via Telegram and Twitter. Coming next:
          per-datacenter dashboards, historical timelines, and tactical
          alerts for operators.
        </p>

        <div class="ecosystem-card-links">
          <a
            href="https://arena.colosseum.org/projects/explore/sonda"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="ecosystem-card-link"
          >
            <span>arena.colosseum.org / sonda</span>
            <svg class="ecosystem-card-link-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M7 17L17 7"></path>
              <path d="M7 7h10v10"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://sonda.network"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="ecosystem-card-link"
          >
            <span>sonda.network</span>
            <svg class="ecosystem-card-link-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M7 17L17 7"></path>
              <path d="M7 7h10v10"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Open-source tooling -->
      <article class="ecosystem-card fade-in">
        <div class="ecosystem-card-top">
          <div class="ecosystem-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">🛠</div>
          <span class="ecosystem-tag">Public goods</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="ecosystem-card-title">Open-source tooling</h3>
        <p class="ecosystem-card-body">
          SONDA, the validator website, and other operator tools are open
          source. All the code lives on GitHub. Anyone can browse it, run
          their own instance, or use parts of it in their own work.
        </p>

        <div class="ecosystem-card-links">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/SolyaUk"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="ecosystem-card-link"
          >
            <span>github.com/SolyaUk</span>
            <svg class="ecosystem-card-link-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M7 17L17 7"></path>
              <path d="M7 7h10v10"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
